{"id":"0e8b07be9e1b2152","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-polynomial-identity-testing.md","title":"整数算术电路恒零判定 ZEROP","display":"df-polynomial-identity-testing — 整数算术电路恒零判定 ZEROP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-polynomial-identity-testing","aliases":["28-df-polynomial-identity-testing"],"display":"df-polynomial-identity-testing — 整数算术电路恒零判定 ZEROP","depends_on":["[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]"],"source_book_location":"Example 20.1; §20.4","source_printed_pages":"402–403,415","source_pdf_pages":"428–429,441","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-polynomial-identity-testing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-polynomial-identity-testing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-identity-testing — 整数算术电路恒零判定 ZEROP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10115bca0ef04fef\" href=\"?note=10115bca0ef04fef\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-circuit\">28-df-arithmetic-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Example 20.1; §20.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"402–403,415"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"428–429,441"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；算术电路 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb Q,n}\">\\(C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb Q,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{poly}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{poly}(C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{asize}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{asize}(C)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"10115bca0ef04fef\" href=\"?note=10115bca0ef04fef\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-circuit\">28-df-arithmetic-circuit</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 为自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>；邻接字串表示连接。下式构造整数前缀码、带符号整数码和电路门表码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle n,C\\rangle\">\\(\\langle n,C\\rangle\\)</span>；只有整数常量标签的电路属于编码域，非法编码不属于下式语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；单比特串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle\\)</span> 对应比特 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n}\\coloneqq\\{C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb Q,n}:\\forall v\\in[N]\\ \\forall a\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(\\tau(v)=(0,a)\\Rightarrow a\\in\\mathbb Z)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n}\\coloneqq\\{C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb Q,n}:\\forall v\\in[N]\\ \\forall a\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(\\tau(v)=(0,a)\\Rightarrow a\\in\\mathbb Z)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j),\\qquad \\operatorname{int}_{\\mathrm Z}(a)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbf1[a&lt;0]\\rangle\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(|a|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j),\\qquad \\operatorname{int}_{\\mathrm Z}(a)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbf1[a&lt;0]\\rangle\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(|a|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{node}_{\\mathrm Z,C}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}00\\operatorname{int}_{\\mathrm Z}(a)&amp;\\tau(v)=(0,a),\\\\01\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(i)&amp;\\tau(v)=(1,i),\\\\10\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(u)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(w)&amp;\\tau(v)=+,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w),\\\\11\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(u)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(w)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\times,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w)\\end{cases}\\quad(C\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n},\\ v\\in[N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{node}_{\\mathrm Z,C}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}00\\operatorname{int}_{\\mathrm Z}(a)&amp;\\tau(v)=(0,a),\\\\01\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(i)&amp;\\tau(v)=(1,i),\\\\10\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(u)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(w)&amp;\\tau(v)=+,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w),\\\\11\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(u)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(w)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\times,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w)\\end{cases}\\quad(C\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n},\\ v\\in[N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle n,C\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(n)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(N)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(o)\\operatorname{node}_{\\mathrm Z,C}(1)\\cdots\\operatorname{node}_{\\mathrm Z,C}(N)\\quad(C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle n,C\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(n)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(N)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(o)\\operatorname{node}_{\\mathrm Z,C}(1)\\cdots\\operatorname{node}_{\\mathrm Z,C}(N)\\quad(C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,C\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land C\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n}\\land\\operatorname{poly}(C)=0\\in\\mathbb Z[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,C\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land C\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n}\\land\\operatorname{poly}(C)=0\\in\\mathbb Z[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>门表码逐项记录所有节点、常量、变量及有序输入端口；自然数码为前缀码，常量符号由其整数值唯一决定。因此编码单射、无额外填充，合法性与结构解析在码长的多项式时间内完成。</p>\n<p>判定对象是形式多项式恒等式，不是只在布尔输入上取零。负常数允许表达减法，保持原书整数 +,−,× 模型；本目录重复输入端口和输入节点计数只造成线性规模差异。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Example 20.1; §20.4；印刷页 402–403,415；PDF 页 428–429,441。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-arithmetic-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"10115bca0ef04fef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-arithmetic-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"10115bca0ef04fef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；算术电路 $C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb Q,n}$、$\\operatorname{poly}(C)$、$\\operatorname{asize}(C)$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]。$\\operatorname{bin}(j)$ 为自然数 $j$ 的无前导零二进制表示，$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$；邻接字串表示连接。下式构造整数前缀码、带符号整数码和电路门表码 $\\langle n,C\\rangle$；只有整数常量标签的电路属于编码域，非法编码不属于下式语言。$j\\in\\mathbb N$，$a\\in\\mathbb Z$；单比特串 $\\langle b\\rangle$ 对应比特 $b\\in\\{0,1\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb Q,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{poly}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{asize}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle n,C\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n}\\coloneqq\\{C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb Q,n}:\\forall v\\in[N]\\ \\forall a\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(\\tau(v)=(0,a)\\Rightarrow a\\in\\mathbb Z)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j),\\qquad \\operatorname{int}_{\\mathrm Z}(a)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbf1[a<0]\\rangle\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(|a|).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{node}_{\\mathrm Z,C}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}00\\operatorname{int}_{\\mathrm Z}(a)&\\tau(v)=(0,a),\\\\01\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(i)&\\tau(v)=(1,i),\\\\10\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(u)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(w)&\\tau(v)=+,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w),\\\\11\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(u)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(w)&\\tau(v)=\\times,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w)\\end{cases}\\quad(C\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n},\\ v\\in[N]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle n,C\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(n)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(N)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm Z}(o)\\operatorname{node}_{\\mathrm Z,C}(1)\\cdots\\operatorname{node}_{\\mathrm Z,C}(N)\\quad(C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,C\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land C\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n}\\land\\operatorname{poly}(C)=0\\in\\mathbb Z[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":3170,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-380","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-e-class]]、[[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]、[[28-thm-uniform-derandomization]]、[[28-thm-pit-randomized-test]]、[[28-thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound]]。"},{"id":"c9ef13719785316e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}$、$\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,k}$、$\\operatorname{poly}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]；$\\operatorname{asize}$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]。$\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 采用 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-nexp]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。$S_n$ 为 $[n]$ 上所有排列；$X=(X_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}$ 为 n² 个形式变量。"}],"outgoing":["10115bca0ef04fef"]}